<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Fell Too Deep With You</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Løvesick</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Fell Too Deep With You</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">2qDE0miwZb5kxezAdhnAzs</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1">1 Contributor</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Fell Too Deep With You Lyrics</p><p ttm:agent="v1">The sky, it is so blue</p><p ttm:agent="v1">It's all because of you</p><p ttm:agent="v1">And when the stars aligned</p><p ttm:agent="v1">The biggest one was mine</p><p ttm:agent="v1">You said it all the time</p><p ttm:agent="v1">But is that still the same way you have loved?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Oh no)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I fell too deep with you</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I fell too deep with you</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I know that it's bad but</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I fell too deep for you</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I fell in for your touch and</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I fell too deep with you</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Why don't you make me be, make me fall onto my knees</p><p ttm:agent="v1">How did it end? I wish somebody that was me could disarm me consistently (consistently)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Fuck that all we need</p><p ttm:agent="v1">There's someone I can be</p><p ttm:agent="v1">We're falling way too deep, right?</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I wish you still werе mine</p><p ttm:agent="v1">We're running out of timе</p><p ttm:agent="v1">My God, our love will die</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I still can't comprehend it</p><p ttm:agent="v1">We've been through the worst and now we've been through it all</p><p ttm:agent="v1">And I still can't believe that you're the one that made me fall</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Can't accept the truth (can't accept the truth), can't open a pit (can't have better pain)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Maybe we won't meet again</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Cause it's probably too late for this</p><p ttm:agent="v1">(Oh no)Thought you broke my heart again</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I broke your soul</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I feel too deep with you</p><p ttm:agent="v1">You stabbed me in my chest, my heart is lost</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I fell too deep with you</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I know that it was bad but</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I fell too deep for you</p><p ttm:agent="v1">You died in love again, I'm such a fool</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I fell too deep with you</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Why don't you make me be, make me fall onto my knees</p><p ttm:agent="v1">How did it end? I wish somebody that was me could disarm me consistently (consistently)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Fuck that all we need</p><p ttm:agent="v1">There's someone I can be</p><p ttm:agent="v1">We're falling way too deep, right?</p></div></body></tt>